        <h2>Tony Stark / Iron Man</h2>

        <p>
            <strong>Universe:</strong> Marvel
        </p>

        <p>
            <strong>Role:</strong> Hero
        </p>

        <p>
            <strong>Species:</strong> Human
        </p>

        <p>
            <strong>Abilities:</strong>
           Flight, Money, Laser beams, Genius
        </p>

        <p>
            <strong>Personality:</strong>
            arrogant,outgoing, quick-witted, and brilliant
        </p>

        <p>
            <strong>Backstory:</strong>
            Tony Stark is captured by terrorists, suffers a severe chest injury, and builds a high-tech suit of armor to survive and escape, turning into Iron Man.
        </p>

